WEBVTT

00:33:27.579 --> 00:33:30.246
like maybe open I fall behind

00:33:30.246 --> 00:33:33.871
and maybe somebody else feels ajai that
thinks about it in a very different way

00:33:33.871 --> 00:33:37.579
or doesn't care as much as we'd like
about safety and the risks

00:33:37.579 --> 00:33:40.496
or how to strike a different trade off
of how fast we should go with this

00:33:41.204 --> 00:33:43.454
and where we should sort of
just say, like, you know,

00:33:43.496 --> 00:33:45.704
like let's push on for the
economic benefits.

00:33:46.329 --> 00:33:48.746
But I think all of this sort
of like, you know,

00:33:48.746 --> 00:33:53.329
traditionally what's been in the
realm of sci fi risks are real

00:33:53.329 --> 00:33:56.163
and we should not ignore them. And
I still lose sleep over them.

00:33:56.913 --> 00:34:01.579
And just to update people is artificial
general intelligence.